<title>POLAND: EXBUD FEB NET RISES TO PLN 1.1 MLN.</title>
<headline>EXBUD FEB NET RISES TO PLN 1.1 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-03-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results February</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>FEBRUARY</p>
<p> Net profit	     1.05 vs   0.72</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 1.63 vs   1.03</p>
<p> Operating profit     0.53 vs   0.40</p>
<p> Sales		   16.70 vs  20.50</p>
<p>JANUARY-FEBRUARY</p>
<p> Net profit	     1.58 vs   1.27</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 2.41 vs   1.76</p>
<p> Operating profit     0.83 vs   0.83</p>
<p> Sales		   34.28 vs  33.27</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish construction firm is Exbud SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
